# The published plugin is a small whitelist out of a large working tree, so
# everything is ignored and the shipped files are named explicitly. Anything
# new that should be published has to be added here on purpose.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/manifest.json
!/Service.qml
!/BarWidget.qml
!/Panel.qml
!/aquarium/
!/README.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/LICENSE
!/preview.png
!/preview-bit.png
